<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak ING Barings SKK 2bln, 3yr bond issue Dec 20.</title>
<headline>Slovak ING Barings SKK 2bln, 3yr bond issue Dec 20.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Baring Securities (Slovakia) a.s. said on Wednesday it would issue a two billion Slovak crown tranche of three-year bonds on December 20.</p>
<p>The bonds, which will have a nominal value of 100,000 crowns, will carry a fixed annual coupon of 11.2 percent, ING Barings said in a published statement.  </p>
<p>The statement added that ING Barings would lead manage the issue.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
